[{:db/id "q-130256/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "1b5e3d4a-1fd5-54c6-82ea-ac7b15e8a59c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "910c69c9-f1fc-5b56-9790-0e937d68f7e3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "bcbdea94-e7ed-5a29-9cd8-a8fa9c3ad51d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "39a21bfd-d5c3-54f6-91d1-2ee32d7c888b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "c369dc5c-47ad-53fa-bce0-af86b948cf1c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4ce73186-15ae-5fa4-9822-27c04e5d83ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130256/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer-field/choices ["q-130256/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-130256/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-130256/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-130256/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-130256/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130256" :question/id #uuid "3a8a1c12-7f84-5c3b-83f4-8db057221abd" :question/math-academy-id "q-130256" :question/problem "Which of the following are linear differential operators?\n\n- ${D}_{1}(y)=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$\n- ${D}_{2}(y)=2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$\n- ${D}_{3}(y)={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$" :question/worked-solution "For any linear differential operator,\n\n$$\nD(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})=aD({y}_{1})+bD({y}_{2})\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants. \n\nLet's check each case in turn.\n\n- The first operator is **not** linear. To see why, we first evaluate the left-hand side of the linearity condition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{1}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})+(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =a\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+b\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}^{2}{y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+{b}^{2}{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}+ab({y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}+{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is not the same as the right-hand side, because\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a{D}_{1}({y}_{1})+b{D}_{1}({y}_{2}) & =a[\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}]+b[\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}] \\\\  & =a\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+b\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+a{y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+b{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The second operator is indeed linear. To see this, we check the above linearity condition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{2}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) & =2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})-x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =2a\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2b\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-ax\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}-bx\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =a[2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-x\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}]+b[2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-x\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}] \\\\  & =a{D}_{2}({y}_{1})+b{D}_{2}({y}_{2})\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The third operator is also linear. To see this, we check the above linearity condition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{3}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})+2x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =a{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+b{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2ax\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+2bx\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =a[{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2x\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}]+b[{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2x\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}] \\\\  & =a{D}_{3}({y}_{1})+b{D}_{3}({y}_{2})\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130256/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17c792c0-3aec-5e40-8897-2eab9ff2ece0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130256"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-1/eed57234b47a067f377ad0fb0c2a5ad0449cb23356c95b7fa70219a86487d6fc" :answer/id #uuid "485ebd57-6ecb-5560-b90b-18d01cb3562d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})=aL({y}_{1})+bL({y}_{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-1/4d2acbd3973371eb6e2f3212aaba712371c370f4795dd192f70e2c224fa981de" :answer/id #uuid "653efa99-e039-53c7-a6d4-6a9dbe7c997f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L(a{y}_{1}\\cdot b{y}_{2})=abL({y}_{1})\\cdot L({y}_{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-1/dbc99311ee86c41244f38f95f4fcdbdc590e3fb3a7aae092e02bca4dbddb2a61" :answer/id #uuid "e6ba0bef-111e-54a3-b3e8-7008c221a9b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L(a{y}_{1}+b{y}_{2})=L({y}_{1})+L({y}_{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "01219c46-bdee-57bf-bb58-9ede70c87223" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-338094/field-1/eed57234b47a067f377ad0fb0c2a5ad0449cb23356c95b7fa70219a86487d6fc" :answer-field/choices ["q-338094/field-1/eed57234b47a067f377ad0fb0c2a5ad0449cb23356c95b7fa70219a86487d6fc" "q-338094/field-1/4d2acbd3973371eb6e2f3212aaba712371c370f4795dd192f70e2c224fa981de" "q-338094/field-1/dbc99311ee86c41244f38f95f4fcdbdc590e3fb3a7aae092e02bca4dbddb2a61"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-2/dd435f1e145be0e629115aeb4d8f7ca776447eff1cb6585072c928a6e69917ba" :answer/id #uuid "714f0393-3e4c-5e2d-9258-e16d501c55df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}^{2}{y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+{b}^{2}{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-2/4752a5867b774f8bce388323b400d5e942bc55417d09f8b3626ee733d9f8a52a" :answer/id #uuid "13a84697-a4c0-51c3-a1ba-be028cda83ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+{b}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-2/c6d459812ceca89ae4d51ca65b792e4dfdd7b0fced50f4a608ae4aeebb67d489" :answer/id #uuid "7a59c87d-3250-52d3-9f6d-6b9dedb3a225" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a{y}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{1}}{\\text{d}x}+b{y}_{2}\\frac{\\text{d}{y}_{2}}{\\text{d}x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338094/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "da4d8e82-b2c0-587f-81a2-ac34578ba6cc" :answer-field/key "field